orm-cs-vl-indication-confirmation-after-eac">vl-indication-confirmation-after-eac</a></td><td style="color: #cccccc">Confirmation: three to six months after EAC</td><td>Confirmatory viral-load testing three to six months after enhanced adherence counselling.</td></tr><tr><td><a href="CodeSystem-ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-vl-indication-recent-infection">vl-indication-recent-infection</a></td><td style="color: #cccccc">Recent infection</td><td>Viral-load testing requested in the context of recent HIV infection.</td></tr><tr><td><a href="CodeSystem-ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-vl-indication-early-hiv-detection">vl-indication-early-hiv-detection</a></td><td style="color: #cccccc">Early HIV detection</td><td>Viral-load testing requested for early HIV detection.</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>
